OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with strong sunshine,
OL,6,Ftemperatures rising rapidly during the
OL,7,Fmorning. High level cloud will make
OL,8,Fthe skies a little hazy initially just
OL,9,Facross Northumberland but later
OL,10,Felsewhere. Feeling very warm and
OL,11,Flocally hot. Gusty winds easing during
OL,12,Fthe morning.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FHigh level cloud will lead to
OL,15,Fa bright but hazy evening, with dry
OL,16,Fconditions persisting overnight. A few
OL,17,Fclear spells are likely, but another
OL,18,Fwarm night is likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
