OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,6,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,7,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light, but a
OL,8,Flittle brisker near some coasts.
OL,9,FFeeling very warm, locally hot.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,12,Fa little fresher and cloudier from
OL,13,FFriday with perhaps the odd shower by
OL,14,FSaturday. A spell of more organised
OL,15,Frain arriving late Sunday, as winds
OL,16,Fstrengthen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
